course: dictionary
lesson: 9747
title: Supergiant stars
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: A supergiant is a star, and a very big one. The word has two parts: super means very much, and giant means very large. Put them together and you get a star far bigger than most others.
explain: «Betelgeuse, Orion's red shoulder, is a dying red supergiant that will explode as a supernova sometime within about the next 100,000 years; nobody can say exactly when.» The clues are dying and explode. A supergiant is near the end of its life, and then it may explode.
explain: Supergiant can also be an informal word. «A supergiant shark in a film» means an enormous shark. To check which meaning fits, swap in enormous: if the sentence still makes sense, the informal meaning is the one the writer wants.
fact: A supergiant is one of the biggest and brightest kinds of star.
fact: A supergiant is many times larger and heavier than our Sun.
fact: Very massive stars can swell into red supergiants late in their lives.
fact: «Red supergiant» and «blue supergiant» are two kinds: Betelgeuse is a red supergiant in Orion, and Rigel is a blue supergiant.
fact: Informally, «supergiant» can mean enormous, as in «a supergiant shark».
exercise: What is a supergiant? | A planet with rings | A moon that goes around Mars | * One of the biggest and brightest kinds of star | A very small, dim star
exercise: The text says Betelgeuse is a dying red supergiant. What does dying suggest? | It is turning into a moon | It is growing younger | * It is near the end of its life | It has just been born
exercise: In a film, a «supergiant shark» is most likely | * Enormous | Made of glass | Invisible to the eye | Tiny and harmless
test: Which star is named as a blue supergiant in these lessons? | Our Sun | Betelgeuse | The Moon | * Rigel
test: Compared with our Sun, a supergiant is | Exactly the same size | * Many times larger and heavier | Smaller and lighter | Made of ice
exam: Which sentence uses supergiant correctly? | The cat was a supergiant of the house, curled up on the sofa. | * Red supergiants are huge stars that may explode at the end of their lives. | She ran a supergiant race on Tuesday. | Supergiants are small rocks that orbit the Earth.
